title: Drawers3B
---
// Talk target of the chest of drawers in 3B (Interact layer). On the second Thursday the blush socks are in the
// drawers, on the rack or in the moving box, after his answer on Sunday morning
// ($r1_thu2_socks_at, set in Route1Thu2Start).
-> Look
    <<if $r1_thu2_socks_at == "drawers">>
        You: Blush. Top drawer. Where they live now.
        <<set $r1_thu2_socks_noted to true>>
        <<note thu2_socks "The socks?">>
    <<else>>
        You: Shirts, mostly grey. Socks, mostly grey.
    <<endif>>
-> Put the blush socks on <<if $r1_thu2_socks_at == "drawers">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks_at to "">>
    <<set $item_blush_socks to false>>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks to "on">>
    You: Fine. Blush.
-> Take the blush socks <<if $r1_thu2_socks_at == "drawers">>
    <<set $r1_thu2_socks_at to "">>
    <<set $item_blush_socks to true>>
===
